  "label": "absurdity as comedic device",
  "description": "The humor in the meme stems from the absurdity of the situation — a dishwasher being 'born' — which is inherently illogical. This requires background knowledge about comedy techniques, particularly the use of absurdity to generate laughter. The juxtaposition of a mundane kitchen appliance with a biological concept (birth) creates the comedic effect.",
